{"id":2326,"date":"2018-08-06T00:05:21","date_gmt":"2018-08-06T07:05:21","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=2326"},"modified":"2018-08-06T00:05:21","modified_gmt":"2018-08-06T07:05:21","slug":"february-26-2018-ccra-roster-has-been-posted","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2018\/08\/06\/february-26-2018-ccra-roster-has-been-posted\/","title":{"rendered":"August 6, 2018 CCRA Roster has Been Posted"},"content":{"rendered":"<header class=\"entry-header\"><\/header>\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<p>The Contra Costa Repeater Association\u2019s <a title=\"August 6, 2018 Membership Roster\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/180806-CCRA-Roster.pdf \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">August 6, 2018 CCRA Membership Roster<\/a> has been posted.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"entry-content\">The CCRA Roster has three changes since our last roster of June 30, 2018.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div class=\"entry-content\">Bob White has changed his call from KK6WSC to the vanity callsign, K6RWW.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div class=\"entry-content\">Bob Gallagher, KA6IRT of Pleasanton and\u00a0 John Glass, NU6P from Saratoga have rejoined after many years of absence from the CCRA.\u00a0 Welcome back Bob and John!<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Contra Costa Repeater Association\u2019s August 6, 2018 CCRA Membership Roster has been posted. The CCRA Roster has three changes since our last roster of June 30, 2018. Bob White <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2018\/08\/06\/february-26-2018-ccra-roster-has-been-posted\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_co